WEBVTT

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:16.320
To beat Barrett, I need to 
destroy his Beastborg.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:19.200
That's why I summoned Dark Rebellion...

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:20.970
But then he used a new chain.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.170
L-Look out.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.850
Beastborg Medal of the Crimson Chain's effect

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:35.710
also restricts its target monster's controller.

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:40.000
Now, you cannot activate
 spell and trap cards,

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.400
or summon and Special Summon monsters.

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:46.880
Damn... That means...

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.960
I really am... helpless.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:52.840
Your two monsters cannot attack,

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:56.980
and you, yourself, cannot fight in any way!

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:01.790
If you surrender now and tell 
me Yuzu Hiiragi's location,

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:03.440
I'll spare your life.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:04.940
Yuzu?

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:09.160
Yes, my goal in coming to 
the Synchro Dimension

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:14.280
was to bring Lady Serena and Yuzu 
Hiiragi safely back to the Professor.

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:17.370
I have already found Lady Serena.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:19.860
All that remains is Yuzu Hiiragi.

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:22.300
Yuya Sakaki...

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:26.680
I know that you were serving on the 
Lancers with Dennis Mackfield,

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:29.900
and that you had some interaction 
with Yuzu Hiiragi!

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:32.840
So Dennis really was...

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:34.980
Where is Yuzu Hiiragi?

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:37.210
Stop resisting, and tell me.

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:39.540
If you hide it, I will show you no mercy.

00:01:40.190 --> 00:01:42.710
Now, confess! Tell me!

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:45.050
I'd never tell you.

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:46.380
What?

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:54.690
I swore I'd never let Serena or Yuzu be 
sent to the prison that is Academia!

00:01:55.050 --> 00:02:00.400
Fool. You still intend to fight, 
with all options lost to you?

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:02.460
I won't give up...

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:04.480
No matter how far you drive me back,

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:08.810
I'll protect my allies, 
Serena and Yuzu, to the end!

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:11.590
Yuya...

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:14.090
Admirable dedication.

00:02:14.090 --> 00:02:16.190
End your turn, then.

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:20.840
I'll see how far that determination gets you!

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:24.310
I end my turn.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:27.530
D-Wheels.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:31.760
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:33.500
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:36.880
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:39.020
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:17.970
Chance Reunion of Destiny

00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:19.700
My turn!

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:24.440
When I have only one card in my hand, 
I can Special Summon this card.

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:27.380
Appear, Carrier Sentinel!

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:32.520
When I successfully summon Carrier Sentinel,

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:36.650
I can add one Beast-Warrior Monster 
from my deck to my hand.

00:04:37.730 --> 00:04:41.360
I choose to add Pitch-Black Warwolf!

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:46.830
Continuous Spell Beastborg Fusioner's effect

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:50.170
lets me fuse Pitch-Black Warwolf, in my hand,

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:53.040
with Carrier Sentinel on the field!

00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:55.770
Battlefield wolf with bared fangs,

00:04:55.770 --> 00:05:00.510
become one with the storied sentinel, 
and become a new bestial hero!

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:02.250
Fusion Summon!

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:08.330
Appear, Level 6 Beastborg Wolf Kampfer!

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:13.630
I'll thoroughly interrogate you, until you 
give me Yuzu Hiiragi's location.

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:16.900
First, Panther Predator's monster effect.

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:22.930
Once per turn, I can deal half of its 
attack points as damage to you!

00:05:23.910 --> 00:05:26.400
Panther Predator has 1600 attack points.

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:29.500
Therefore, it deals 800 damage.

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:41.960
In that instant, the effect of Beastborg 
Medal of the Steel Chain activates!

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:45.020
When you take damage,

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:49.790
the attack points of all monsters on your side 
of the field decrease by the same amount.

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:57.350
Odd-Eyes!

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:58.630
Dark Rebellion!

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:01.070
It's no use!

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:07.900
All you can do now is surrender and 
tell me Yuzu Hiiragi's location.

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:10.550
If you don't, your suffering will continue.

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:15.600
Dennis told me you came to the Synchro 
Dimension to look for Yuzu Hiiragi,

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:19.110
and that you were participating 
in the same tournament.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:22.810
You must know where Yuzu Hiiragi is!

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:24.870
Even if I knew, I wouldn't tell!

00:06:24.870 --> 00:06:29.630
I won't let you have Yuzu! Or Serena, either!

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:49.650
I won't... let you have... Serena!

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:20.050
Lay... ra...

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:21.150
Stop it!

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:22.480
Don't touch Layra!

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:24.420
I'm the one you should worry about!

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:27.340
Don't be... afraid.

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:33.720
I made... the decision... to fight!

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:36.120
Your name is Layra, yes?

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:38.520
I hope that you set your mind to something.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:42.220
So that, someday, I can see you gallantly duel.

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:46.210
I've decided, too.

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:50.420
I can't run away. I'm going to fight properly.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.050
I won't let you have Serena!

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:55.750
And I won't let any of you leave this place!

00:07:57.920 --> 00:07:59.190
Back then...

00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:01.730
I was able to fight...

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:06.900
I beat... security...

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:10.970
So... this time, too...

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:13.880
I'm sure of it...

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:16.170
It's enough.

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:19.510
You've done enough... Layra.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:25.440
You've fought enough.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:28.350
You protected me...

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:30.590
No... No.

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:38.300
I don't want to see you or Yuya... 
get hurt for my sake anymore.

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:41.030
I'll fight, too...

00:08:41.490 --> 00:08:44.640
I'll protect myself.

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:54.480
No... Serena!

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:03.860
Battle!

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:06.790
Frightfur Tiger!

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:09.260
Frightfur Sheep!

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:12.230
Frightfur Leo!

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:21.910
What in the world?

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:36.020
Sora... You came!

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:39.720
You're the boy who...

00:09:46.030 --> 00:09:47.600
S-Stay back!

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:51.040
I won't return to Academia!

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:54.950
It isn't like that. I didn't come 
here to take you back!

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:57.010
Don't lie to me.

00:09:57.010 --> 00:09:58.520
It's true that, back then,

00:09:58.520 --> 00:10:04.150
I was in the Standard Dimension, obeying the 
Professor to bring you back to Academia.

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:06.480
But that isn't the case now.

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:08.950
What's changed, exactly?

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:12.790
I... I...

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:16.190
I'm on your side.

00:10:19.420 --> 00:10:23.870
Oh? Does that mean you're 
betraying the Professor?

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:37.280
He has the same face as me!

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:41.080
Then, he's... the Fusion Dimension's...

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:58.370
To betray the Professor, while wearing 
an Academia uniform...

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:01.900
Do you think I'll allow that?

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:06.080
I'm talking to you, too.

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:07.610
Are you listening?

00:11:08.050 --> 00:11:14.160
Well, as far as Academia is concerned, 
that means you're terrible criminals.

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:17.520
To turn against the Professor 
is utterly unheard of.

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:21.260
Which means you're both under arrest.

00:11:34.370 --> 00:11:35.610
Now...

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:39.610
Just arresting you would be boring, 
so how about a little game?

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:42.080
A game, you say?

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:46.320
Yes, I was hoping to duel you.

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:48.710
Duel me?

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:51.050
Or maybe not?

00:11:51.050 --> 00:11:53.790
You look like you're having trouble standing.

00:11:54.260 --> 00:11:56.530
What about you, then?

00:11:56.900 --> 00:12:01.470
Though, you might get an execution 
rather than an arrest...

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:03.230
Bringing you back would be quite an ordeal.

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:05.480
You, execute me?

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:09.290
Fine. I'll face you—

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:11.850
I found you, you grinning jerk!

00:12:15.570 --> 00:12:17.560
You won't get away this time.

00:12:17.560 --> 00:12:18.780
Duel me!

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:22.440
You again? You are truly persistent.

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:25.790
I'm a bit busy now, so can't it wait?

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:27.280
Shut up!

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:30.760
Do you realize how long I've waited for this?

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:33.880
Ever since you kidnapped Rin...

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:35.960
I was just following orders.

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:39.140
You wouldn't fault a man for 
following orders, would you?

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:41.470
Orders? Whose?

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:44.110
The Professor's, of course.

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:48.080
The same goes for now. I need 
to take Serena back.

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:50.450
Serena?

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:53.650
What are you doing here?

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:56.230
After I beat you, weren't you sent underground?

00:12:56.850 --> 00:12:59.360
You beat Serena?

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:02.860
Is that right? I see.

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:06.840
Then, maybe I'll make do with you.

00:13:10.570 --> 00:13:15.010
Sorry, I'll have to deal with you later.

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:20.710
It's no use. If you want to fight Lord 
Joeri, you'll have to wait your turn.

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:22.560
That's right.

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:24.010
And if I may warn you,

00:13:24.010 --> 00:13:27.640
I can't have you Obelisk Force 
acting out of turn, either.

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:28.190
Yes, sir.

00:13:28.610 --> 00:13:31.550
I'm the one who will take Serena back.

00:13:31.550 --> 00:13:33.160
So wait there, quietly.

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:35.440
Now that Lord Joeri is here,

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:38.360
you cannot possibly protect Lady Serena.

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:40.630
Yuzu Hiiragi, either, of course.

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:43.790
Tell me! Where is Yuzu Hiiragi?!

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:44.600
Tell me now!

00:13:44.930 --> 00:13:48.070
I said even if I knew, I wouldn't say!

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:49.930
You're a stubborn one.

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.080
If you won't tell me...

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:52.750
Battle.

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:57.050
I attack Odd-Eyes Pendulum 
Dragon with Wolf Kampfer!

00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:11.330
But Beastborg Medal of the Steel Chain's effect 
means that Odd-Eyes isn't destroyed!

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:15.530
But your monsters' attack points 
go down even further.

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:26.490
Wolf Kampfer's effect activates, as well!

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:29.210
When you take damage,

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:32.680
it deals another 300 points to you.

00:14:36.280 --> 00:14:41.160
Then, in that instant, Beastborg Medal 
of the Steel Chain's effect activates!

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:44.500
Your dragons' attack points 
lessen by another 300.

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:49.440
Talk!

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:50.670
Make it easy on yourself!

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:53.370
I'll protect them! Both Yuzu and Serena!

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:55.970
Yuya...

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:02.780
So you finally want to fight, eh?

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:07.530
Yes, I don't want to leave a blemish 
on Academia's history.

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:10.520
Sorry, but I'll have to get serious.

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:12.380
I'm gonna get serious, too!

00:15:12.380 --> 00:15:15.490
I'm gonna pound you down and take back Rin!

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:18.460
I told you that Rin isn't here...

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:21.670
Stop talking, and get ready to fight!

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:25.880
Duel!

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:29.130
I'll take the first move!

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:32.200
My turn!

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:37.680
When there are no monsters on my side of 
the field, I can Special Summon this card!

00:15:38.240 --> 00:15:41.380
Appear, Speedroid Terrortop!

00:15:43.050 --> 00:15:44.840
And another one.

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:47.070
When a Wind Attribute Monster is on my field,

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:51.240
I can Special Summon Speedroid 
Taketomborg from my hand.

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:55.400
One more time!

00:15:55.400 --> 00:16:00.200
I summon Tuner Monster Speedroid 
Red-Eyed Dice from my hand!

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:03.290
Now, all the players are on the stage.

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:05.600
I'll finish this on the first turn!

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:12.450
Level 1 Red-Eyed Dice tunes Level 3 
Speedroid Terrortop and Taketomborg!

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:21.020
Flap your beautiful and heroic wings,

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:23.390
to strike the enemy at the speed of light!

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:25.130
Synchro Summon!

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:30.330
Appear... Level 7 Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:05.310
Let's go. It's time to get things started.

00:17:05.310 --> 00:17:08.920
Yeah, it's finally time for us 
to take control of the city.

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:11.940
We'll overturn this world that's controlled by Tops!

00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:15.050
First, we need to gather allies.

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:21.390
Let the Commons throughout City know that 
we've returned from the depths of hell!

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:22.680
Yeah!

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:31.200
Where are they?

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:32.790
Where are Academia's soldiers?

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:43.790
Listen, be very careful.

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:46.680
Not just of security, but of Academia, too.

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:48.250
We got it.

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:51.850
But we've never seen Academia's guys before...

00:17:51.850 --> 00:17:54.150
He just means to avoid anyone suspicious.

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:55.770
That's right.

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:59.360
Then, we'll split up and look for 
Yuya, Serena, and Yuzu.

00:17:59.630 --> 00:18:00.620
Okay.

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:01.690
Leave it to us.

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:06.660
When it comes to Sora, we know 
him better than you, Crow.

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:10.540
Yeah, I'm surprised you 
already knew each other.

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:17.660
According to Sora, Academia is after Serena.

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:21.160
I hope that he and Yuya can keep Serena safe...

00:18:21.970 --> 00:18:25.050
But we don't know how many 
troops Academia sent.

00:18:25.590 --> 00:18:28.650
If he's having trouble, I'll help him out!

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:31.130
I will, too!

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:32.380
Same here!

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:37.910
You don't even have duel disks. 
What are you talking about?

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:40.110
I'm counting on you guys!

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:41.130
Yeah!

00:18:46.760 --> 00:18:48.710
Where are you? Where did you go, Yuzu?

00:18:48.990 --> 00:18:52.270
Look... Don't we have to get to Layra?

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:55.680
He's fighting alone to protect 
Serena from Academia!

00:18:55.680 --> 00:18:58.160
Layra can't keep her safe, on his own.

00:18:58.160 --> 00:18:59.880
We have to get going.

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:04.960
Tsukikage has gone on ahead of us.

00:19:04.960 --> 00:19:08.160
We'll head toward Layra, while searching for Yuzu.

00:19:08.490 --> 00:19:13.200
If Academia is here, Yuya's probably 
working to protect Serena, too.

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:15.690
If we're searching for the girl 
who's searching for Yuya,

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:17.420
we'll get two birds with one stone.

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:19.400
Okay, let's hurry.

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:30.460
I am worried for Lady Yuzu, but she 
has other allies searching for her.

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:33.320
For now, I must aid Master Layra.

00:19:33.840 --> 00:19:35.290
Wait for me!

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:38.490
What? The prisoners underground escaped?

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:42.800
Send security from across City to deal with it.

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:45.600
We don't have the forces to strike at Academia!

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:49.980
Academia's army is amassing in area RT55.

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:53.570
It appears they're trying to surround 
Serena, who is in the area.

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:56.810
I cannot let them take Serena or Yuzu Hiiragi!

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:13.410
My bracelet...

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:14.760
Is something happening to Yuya?

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:21.700
This way?

00:20:27.630 --> 00:20:30.370
M-My bracelet again...

00:20:30.770 --> 00:20:32.840
I now end my turn.

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:40.780
How cool!

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:44.520
I'll have to do my best, too.

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:46.790
My turn.

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:53.980
I activate my spell card Polymerization 
from my hand,

00:20:53.980 --> 00:21:00.970
to fuse Predaplant Flytrap and Predaplant 
Moray Nepenthes in my hand!

00:21:00.970 --> 00:21:05.400
Two beautiful flowers, which use alluring 
fragrance to attract insects.

00:21:07.290 --> 00:21:11.780
Now become one, and from the 
hell of your petals,

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:14.490
birth a new terror.

00:21:16.090 --> 00:21:17.990
Fusion Summon!

00:21:18.610 --> 00:21:22.170
Appear, poisonous dragon with hungry fangs!

00:21:23.460 --> 00:21:28.070
Level 8 Starving Venom Fusion Dragon!

00:21:35.740 --> 00:21:37.610
Wh-What is this?

00:23:49.610 --> 00:23:52.060
The bracelet's reactions are strengthening.

00:23:52.060 --> 00:23:54.340
I just know something is happening to Yuya.

00:23:54.340 --> 00:23:56.650
Tell me. Where is Yuya right now?

00:23:56.650 --> 00:23:58.240
I've been...

00:23:58.240 --> 00:23:59.910
...waiting for this moment.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:01.670
